  "goodToKnow": "Die Beleuchtung is lighting or illumination: die Straßenbeleuchtung, die Weihnachtsbeleuchtung. In Germany, bicycles must have working Beleuchtung by law, and police do check. Beleuchten means to light up, and figuratively to examine: ein Problem von allen Seiten beleuchten (to look at a problem from all sides). From leuchten (to shine) and das Licht. Die Beleuchtungsanlage is a lighting system."
